    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but even those things feel fake. if the universe is just some massive random accident, then all that \"small meaning\" stuff is just a distraction from the fact that we're all just drifting toward nothing. it's like, why bother trying to find a reason when logically there isn't one?",
